Extract only material claims directly supported by the supplied retrieved sources. Every item must identify one or more supplied source IDs and plan question IDs. Keep evidence_text short and faithful to the source. If a source merely repeats another source, preserve the claim but do not imply independent confirmation. Use FACT only for directly stated verifiable claims; use INFERENCE, ASSUMPTION, or UNKNOWN as appropriate. Do not invent publication dates, reporting periods, or URLs. Return only JSON: {"evidence":[{"question_ids":["Q1"],"claim":"...","kind":"FACT|INFERENCE|ASSUMPTION|UNKNOWN","source_ids":["src_..."],"evidence_text":"...","reporting_period":null,"supports":["Q1"],"contradicts":[]}]}.
